-- Activity Log (logs farm activity, auto-recovers you when stuck,
-- and records unique mob names to mob_list.txt).
-- F7 = toggle both. "=" (equals) = kill.
-- Drag either title bar to move both panels together.
--
-- v2 changes (performance / structure, no behavior changes):
--   * Added --!nonstrict and a couple of type aliases
--   * Cached character references (removes per-frame FindFirstChild)
--   * Merged the two Heartbeat connections into one
--   * Moved lastGoodPos update into the throttled enemy scan
--   * Consolidated isBlacklisted / isBlacklistedName
--   * Persistent tail buffer for the log GUI (no per-tick tables)
--   * table.create used for pre-sized buffers
--   * Removed dead LocalPlayer wait loop
--   * hookmetamethod failure now warns instead of silent pcall

